#
# 17 SEPTEMBER 2026 — THE FEMININE FORMS. Every group above this line that has a
# Latin feminine had nowhere to put her: eight Joannas, two Josephas, two
# Georgias and a Jacoba fell out of the fold entirely, and so out of every
# variant list built from it. That is the worst possible place for a hole. The
# women of this tree are already its weakest part — seven direct ancestors carry
# no surname at all — and the one tool that would have helped a searcher find
# them was built from the men.
